# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets & credentials — NEVER commit these.
# Put real values in a local `.env` file; document variable NAMES only in
# `.env.example` (which is deliberately NOT ignored).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.env
.envrc
.secrets/
secrets/
*.secret
*.secrets

